Host stand-ins for building ESP-IDF's own components/sdmmc/sdmmc_cmd.c and
sdmmc_common.c (188e3e55bb) on the PC, with their real headers
(components/sdmmc/include, esp_hal_sd/include, esp_common/include,
esp_blockdev/include): the log, the checks, the heap, FreeRTOS's delay and
task handle, the ROM's delay, esp_timer and the S31 host's D0 line.  The
clock, the delays and the D0 line are idf_card.c's pretend ones.
